        "verse": 5
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JOS",
          "chapter": 5,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "For all the people who came out were circumcised; but all the people who were born in the wilderness along the way as they came out of Egypt had not been circumcised.",
      "ko": "그 나온 백성은 다 할례를 받았으나 오직 애굽에서 나온 후 광야 노중에서 난 자는 할례를 받지 못하였음이라",
      "source_text_hash": "d7e667df1accfa131147eaecae255df328332b8096c2509cf8e96e3b4a199f6b",
      "translation_text_hash": "6878db4d088bab9c2afc40e6f1359a0d9ec43d60c8c96d55d8737bf48b20a271",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 나온 백성은 다 할례를 받았으나 오직 애굽에서 나온 후 광야 노중에서 난 자는 할례를 받지 못하였음이라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "6878db4d088bab9c2afc40e6f1359a0d9ec43d60c8c96d55d8737bf48b20a271"
