      "en": "When they were done circumcising the whole nation, they stayed in their places in the camp until they were healed.",
      "ko": "온 백성에게 할례 행하기를 필하매 백성이 진중 각 처소에 처하여 낫기를 기다릴 때에",
      "source_text_hash": "abc05620ca9a13e9a2d1260a81471f584e6911c27263f4fbe9977f7b62daea2d",
      "translation_text_hash": "fa4d41aa402d339214a8fa835da7ea21c39c4fd25445eab96aa613af32efc705",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "온 백성에게 할례 행하기를 필하매 백성이 진중 각 처소에 처하여 낫기를 기다릴 때에"
      ],
